1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,141
You've been thrown out of a

2
00:00:01,221 --> 00:00:02,702
spaceship with no suit.

3
00:00:03,242 --> 00:00:04,283
You don't explode.

4
00:00:04,663 --> 00:00:06,104
Your skin holds you together.

5
00:00:06,565 --> 00:00:07,645
But don't hold your breath.

6
00:00:08,046 --> 00:00:09,287
The air in your lungs would

7
00:00:09,347 --> 00:00:10,207
tear them apart.

8
00:00:10,768 --> 00:00:11,328
Breathe out...

9
00:00:12,229 --> 00:00:14,030
and you have about fifteen seconds

10
00:00:14,090 --> 00:00:15,091
before you pass out.

11
00:00:15,531 --> 00:00:17,052
The water on your tongue starts

12
00:00:17,092 --> 00:00:17,653
to boil.

13
00:00:18,153 --> 00:00:19,634
And you won't freeze instantly.

14
00:00:20,154 --> 00:00:21,335
Space is a vacuum,

15
00:00:21,555 --> 00:00:22,996
so heat leaves you slowly.

16
00:00:23,477 --> 00:00:24,437
In direct sunlight,

17
00:00:24,578 --> 00:00:26,199
you'd get the worst sunburn of

18
00:00:26,219 --> 00:00:26,759
your life.

19
00:00:27,279 --> 00:00:28,801
Get pulled back inside within a

20
00:00:28,841 --> 00:00:29,501
minute or so,

21
00:00:29,821 --> 00:00:31,142
and you'd probably survive.

22
00:00:31,623 --> 00:00:33,144
So you reach for the airlock

23
00:00:33,184 --> 00:00:33,444
door...

